- runtime/com/desc/*.idef: lists of Direct3D 11, DXGI, XAudio2 and MMDevice interface names, interface IDs,
  method order and parameter types, generated by runtime/com/gen_desc.py from the MinGW-w64 headers and
  Wine 10.0's IDL files (Wine: LGPL 2.1 or later). Only those interface facts are recorded; no header text.
- Python packages used at build and test time, installed by `./tfrecomp setup` and not included here:
  capstone (BSD) and unicorn (GPL-2.0).
